  "title": {
   "en": "Takamine-san wa, Asuka-kun to Asobitai."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "高嶺さんは、飛鳥くんと遊びたい。"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Takamine-san has the air of a haughty girl, but she loves to play like an elementary school kid. Asuka-kun is burly and fierce-looking, but he is actually gentle and kind. The two enjoy playing old-fashioned games together, but every time, they inevitably end up in a heart-stopping situation...? This is a four-panel love-comedy with maximum joy, featuring two precious kids that you will want to watch over and protect!",
   "ja": "「見た目はいいけど中身は小学生（友人談）」な高校生・高嶺さんは、罰ゲームの「好きな人を告白する」を「好きな人に告白する」と勘違いし、飛鳥くんを屋上に呼び出し告白！見た目がゴツイけど実は優しくてイイ奴な飛鳥くんが出した結論は……ＯＫ！"
  },
